izing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; list-style: inherit;\">Monthly free store vouchers/products for&nbsp;Micro-influencers or beyond (More than 10,000 followers on Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, TikTok, Pinterest)</li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; list-style: inherit;\">Free worldwide shipping</li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; list-style: inherit;\">Exclusive designer brands</li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; list-style: inherit;\">Frequently added new brands and styles</li><li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style: inherit;\">Regular newsletters about new product arrivals, features and offers</li></ul></div>",
